The story does not specify when Madame de Merret dies or when people are allowed to enter the manor.

However, the question asks: "How long after Madame de Merret dies before people are allowed inter manor?"

"Inter manor" is likely a typo or misphrasing; the story discusses "la Grande Breteche" (the house/manor) and restrictions on entering it due to the will of Madame de Merret (likely "Madame de Merret" referring to the Comtesse de Merret, though the text says "Madame de Merret" in the narrative;
